findings.evidence:
Reproduced via logging.Setup (Redaction{Headers: ["X-Api-Key"]}):

JSON format:
 l.Info("resp", "r", map[string]any{"body": `{"Set-Cookie":"sid=SECRETSID","X-Api-Key":"SECRETKEY"}`})
 -> {...,"msg":"resp","r":{"body":"{\"Set-Cookie\":\"sid=SECRETSID\",\"X-Api-Key\":\"SECRETKEY\"}"}}
 l.Info("resp", "r", struct{ Body string }{`{"Set-Cookie":"sid=SECRETSID"}`})
 -> {...,"r":{"Body":"{\"Set-Cookie\":\"sid=SECRETSID\"}"}}
(text format for the same calls: r="map[body:{\"Set-Cookie\":[REDACTED]")

Raw writer, either format, both lines pass through unchanged:
 {"level":"info","msg":"hdrs {\"Cookie\": \"session=SECRETCOOKIE\"}"}
 time=x level=INFO msg="hdrs {\"Cookie\": \"session=SECRETCOOKIE\"}"
